#   f "[mc], could you…?"
    f "[mc], ¿podrías...?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3178
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_9f6969c3:

#   mc "Yeah. Sure."
    mc "Sí, claro."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3181
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_a643c54f:

#   k "I… wow. I can’t believe this place is yours. How did you manage all this so fast?"
    k "No puedo creer que este sitio sea tuyo. ¿Cómo has conseguido todo esto tan rápido?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3182
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_1cf4eede:

#   k "Was it because of the people who attacked our family? Just… tell me the truth."
    k "¿Fue por la gente que atacó a nuestra familia? Sólo... dime la verdad."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3184
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_b519251d:

#   f "Oh please, sis. You really think I could afford this?"
    f "Por favor, hermanita, ¿de verdad crees que puedo permitírmelo?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3185
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_4e9bd42f:

#   f "The monthly rent alone would bury me."
    f "Sólo el alquiler mensual me enterraría."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3187
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_0d7bee1f:

#   f "It belongs to an associate of mine."
    f "Pertenece a un socio mío."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3188
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_91c15c93:

#   f "Athena. She runs NewsWave. She’s… intense, to put it mildly."
    f "Athena. Dirige NewsWave. Es... intensa, por decirlo suavemente."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3190
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_5e01bc8b:

#   k "I’ve heard of her."
    k "He oído hablar de ella."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3191
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_c761f1e3:

#   k "It’s a beautiful place."
    k "Es un lugar precioso."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3193
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_8ae7fd6d:

#   f "It is. I got lucky. She offered me a room. I share it with my friend [bl]."
    f "Lo es. Tuve suerte. Me ofreció una habitación. La comparto con mi amiga [bl]."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3194
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_fcf49d09:

#   f "That is... after our lovely father kicked me out of the place mama originally set up for me."
    f "Es decir... después de que nuestro adorable padre me echara del lugar que mamá me había preparado originalmente."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3199
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_f90834af:

#   k "You and… [lil]? You worked together?"
    k "¿Tú y... [lil]? ¿Trabajabais juntos?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3201
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_d80b9e29:

#   f "She saved me, [k]. She didn’t just get me a place."
    f "Ella me salvó, [k] no sólo me consiguió una plaza."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3202
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_2f258598:

#   f "She sent me money every month so I wouldn’t starve. Until father cut that off too."
    f "Me enviaba dinero todos los meses para que no me muriera de hambre. Hasta que padre también me lo cortó."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3204
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_c329cabd:

#   f "I owe her more than I could ever repay."
    f "Le debo más de lo que jamás podré pagarle."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3205
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_7189ca30:

#   f "I think she wanted me out of [z]’s reach. She was happy I escaped."
    f "Creo que me quería fuera del alcance de [z]. Se alegró de que escapara."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3207
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_3f203782:

#   k "Then why didn’t she do the same for me?"
    k "Entonces, ¿por qué no hizo lo mismo por mí?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3209
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_975ebbb7:

#   f "Did you ever show fear or anger about what dad was doing?"
    f "¿Alguna vez mostraste miedo o enfado por lo que hacía papá?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3211
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_1d516a70:

#   k "No. I… I thought he was just rough. But he was always kind to me in his own way."
    k "No. Yo... creía que sólo era brusco. Pero siempre fue amable conmigo, a su manera."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3213
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_e7185ea6:

#   f "You were his golden eye. And yeah, he loved you. I’m sure of that. He just… wasn’t the same with me."
    f "Eras su ojo de oro. Y sí, te quería, de eso estoy segura. Sólo que... no era lo mismo conmigo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3216
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_7c2bde7e:

#   k "Why?"
    k "¿Por qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3218
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_5c7d5a01:

#   f "I look too much like our mother. Every time he saw me, he was reminded of what happened to her."
    f "Me parezco demasiado a nuestra madre. Cada vez que me veía, recordaba lo que le ocurrió a ella."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3219
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_7eeabb0e:

#   f "The more he looked, the more he hated me. And I didn’t exactly make it easy on him either."
    f "Cuanto más miraba, más me odiaba. Y yo tampoco se lo puse fácil precisamente."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3220
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_7c6f78e9:

#   f "You were different. Maybe that’s why he hid everything from you. He was afraid you’d run away like I did."
    f "Tú eras diferente. Quizá por eso te lo ocultó todo. Temía que huyeras como hice yo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3222
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_146d86cb:

#   k "I wish I’d known sooner… I could’ve run with you."
    k "Ojalá lo hubiera sabido antes... podría haber corrido contigo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3224
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_91d0abea:

#   f "You couldn’t. I was barely holding myself together. You were still a kid."
    f "No podías. Apenas me sostenía. Aún eras una niña."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3226
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_e6a5e67e:

#   k "I know. I just… I hate how all of this turned out."
    k "Lo sé. Es que... odio cómo ha acabado todo esto."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3228
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_fda6901f:

#   f "Look, I’m not saying [lil] did a flawless job. She didn’t. She could’ve told you pieces of the truth earlier."
    f "Mira, no estoy diciendo que [lil] hiciera un trabajo impecable</b0>. No lo hizo. Podría haberte contado partes de la verdad antes."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3229
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_c4c8fdb4:

#   f "Maybe she thought you and dad had something good. Maybe she didn’t want to break that."
    f "Quizá pensó que papá y tú teníais algo bueno y no quiso romperlo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3231
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_72e74f89:

#   k "He helped me build my charity… Not that any of it matters anymore."
    k "Me ayudó a construir mi obra benéfica... No es que nada de eso importe ya."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3233
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_a0111f50:

#   k "I don’t know what to do."
    k "No sé qué hacer."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3235
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_10f76723:

#   f "What can you do? Your old life is gone. It sucks, yeah, but rock-bottom means you can only go up."
    f "¿Qué puedes hacer? Tu antigua vida ha desaparecido. Es un asco, sí, pero tocar fondo significa que sólo puedes ir hacia arriba."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3236
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_bf64c000:

#   f "I’ll help you. I have some savings. We could live together. Rebuild from scratch… if that’s something you’d want."
    f "Te ayudaré. Tengo algunos ahorros. Podríamos vivir juntos. Reconstruir desde cero... si es algo que te gustaría."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3238
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_7e0a8d55:

#   k "I’m not sure…"
    k "No estoy seguro..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3240
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_1c08d678:

#   k "Y-you’ve worked with them… with the [hns] people."
    k "Has trabajado con ellos... con la gente de [hns]."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3242
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_61a498b6:

#   f "I had nothing to do with what happened to you. I swear."
    f "No tuve nada que ver con lo que te pasó, te lo juro."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3243
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_56226c16:

#   k "And to dad? Twice?"
    k "¿Y a papá? ¿Dos veces?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3245
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_84c20621:

#   f "Once. Yes. I wanted the bastard to pay for what he did to me and mama."
    f "Una vez. Sí. Quería que ese cabrón pagara por lo que nos hizo a mamá y a mí."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3246
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_28a65a94:

#   f "But the goal wasn’t to kill him. You have to believe me."
    f "Pero el objetivo no era matarle, tienes que creerme."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3249
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_2fd0cb57:

#   f "[mc], [lil] and I… umm... honestly, it was mostly [mc] and [lil]. They planned our big reunion. Coming clean about everything at the party."
    f "[mc], [lil] y yo... umm... sinceramente, fueron sobre todo [mc] y [lil]. Ellos planearon nuestra gran reunión. Se sinceraron sobre todo en la fiesta."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3251
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_54deed50:

#   f "[mc]? You can come in now."
    f "[mc] Ya puedes entrar."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3252
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_44a05638:

#   f "I was just telling [k] about… your whole reunion plan."
    f "Le estaba contando a [k] sobre... todo tu plan de reunión."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3254
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_5dd38ec8:

#   mc "The plan was good. The execution was a fucking disaster."
    mc "El plan era bueno, la ejecución fue un puto desastre."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3255
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_fd204d59:

#   k "So that’s why you asked me so many questions about [f]?"
    k "¿Por eso me has hecho tantas preguntas sobre [f]?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3256
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_5a85757e:

#   k "To see if I still hated her? What happened to us…?"
    k "¿Para ver si aún la odiaba? ¿Qué nos pasó...?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3258
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_c9d6ccb6:

#   mc "Yeah. I needed to know if the plan even had a chance."
    mc "Sí. Necesitaba saber si el plan tenía alguna posibilidad."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3259
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_9246936d:

#   mc "But then everything went to hell... [z] suddenly turning on me, all the chaos… the whole plan just collapsed."
    mc "Pero entonces todo se fue al infierno... [z] volviéndose de repente contra mí, todo el caos... todo el plan se vino abajo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3261
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_3ae70435:

#   mc "Before I even processed it, the masquerade started. I had to hide, [f] had to hide… and [luc] did exactly what he was sent to do. Turn you against us."
    mc "Antes incluso de que lo procesara, empezó la mascarada. Tuve que esconderme, [f] tuvo que esconderse... y [luc] hizo exactamente lo que le habían enviado a hacer. Ponerte en nuestra contra."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3262
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_d281c37e:

#   mc "We fucked it up. All of us."
    mc "La hemos cagado todos."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3264
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_b7e3f61e:

#   f "I saw you crying alone. I wanted to go to you so badly, explain everything, hold you, but… I chickened out."
    f "Te vi llorando sola. Tenía tantas ganas de ir hacia ti, explicártelo todo, abrazarte, pero... me acobardé."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3266
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_1f4d2d79:

#   k "And then I saw you fighting with dad. He told me things that I now know were just lies... lies meant to keep us apart."
    k "Y entonces te vi peleándote con papá. Me dijo cosas que ahora sé que no eran más que mentiras... mentiras destinadas a mantenernos separados."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3268
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_196a8402:

#   f "His way of ‘protecting’ you from my terrible influence. Same old story."
    f "Su forma de \"protegerte\" de mi terrible influencia. La misma historia de siempre."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3270
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_32b8a0f4:

#   mc "Everything between us got destroyed in every possible way... And I’m not saying it’s everyone else’s fault."
    mc "Todo lo que había entre nosotros se destruyó de todas las formas posibles... Y no digo que sea culpa de los demás."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3271
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_4d04519d:

#   mc "It’s ours too. We just… didn’t do enough."
    mc "También es nuestro. Simplemente... no hicimos lo suficiente."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3273
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_0d16e9aa:

#   k "It’s mine too."
    k "También es mío."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3274
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_a7a36e71:

#   k "How clueless was I? Everyone in this damn city knew who my father was except me."
    k "Qué despistada era... Todo el mundo en esta maldita ciudad sabía quién era mi padre menos yo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3276
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_2f1290e0:

#   k "... [sa] was right."
    k "... [sa] tenía razón."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3277
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_cc22c3bd:

#   mc "[sa] can be… um… extremely intense."
    mc "[sa] puede ser... um... extremadamente intenso."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3279
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_9477276c:

#   k "Yeah. What she said was true. All of it."
    k "Sí, lo que dijo era cierto, todo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3281
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_e591710c:

#   f "S-so… what now?"
    f "Y... ¿ahora qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3283
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_d5470c37:

#   k "I want to try living with you. To rebuild. To see what having a sister really feels like."
    k "Quiero probar a vivir contigo, a reconstruirme, a ver qué se siente realmente al tener una hermana."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3285
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_37ae57fb:

#   k "And… thank you, [mc]. Really."
    k "Y... gracias, [mc] De verdad."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3289
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_cfa436d7:

#   k "I’d prefer to rebuild my life on my own terms. Without our family stepping in. And… that includes you too."
    k "Prefiero rehacer mi vida en mis propios términos. Sin que nuestra familia se entrometa. Y... eso también te incluye a ti."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3291
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_82f1a8c9:

#   f "I… yeah. I get it."
    f "Yo... sí. Lo entiendo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3292
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_9a84894a:

#   f "I wish we’d had this talk sooner. Honestly. But I was running, scared out of my mind, never sure if you’d side with me or with dad… and I couldn’t risk hearing the wrong answer."
    f "Ojalá hubiéramos tenido esta charla antes. De verdad. Pero estaba huyendo, muerta de miedo, sin saber si te pondrías de mi lado o del de papá... y no podía arriesgarme a oír una respuesta equivocada."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3293
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_a04331f8:

#   f "I’m sorry."
    f "Lo siento."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3295
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_44f4439b:

#   k "Don’t apologize. I don’t hate you. You’ll always be my sister."
    k "No te disculpes, no te odio, siempre serás mi hermana."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3296
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_ca22a046:

#   k "And I’m glad we finally had the chance to talk. Even if it’s… complicated."
    k "Y me alegro de que por fin hayamos podido hablar, aunque sea... complicado."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3298
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_3ec57d49:

#   f "..."
    f "..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3300
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_081782d0:

#   f "[mc]? You can come back in."
    f "[mc] Puedes volver a entrar."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3303
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_ceabc2a9:

#   f "Umm… not to be rude, but the Lady in Black doesn’t let me bring anyone over. House rules."
    f "Umm... no quiero ser grosero, pero la Dama de Negro no me deja traer a nadie. Reglas de la casa."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3304
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_e1d907ec:

#   mc "Then let’s go somewhere else."
    mc "Entonces vamos a otro sitio."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3306
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_fed575a7:

#   k "She doesn’t? Why?"
    k "¿No lo hace? ¿Por qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3308
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_6b68070e:

#   f "She’s obsessed with anonymity. Keeping everything low profile. So you probably shouldn’t mention you’ve ever been here or even know this place exists."
    f "Está obsesionada con el anonimato, con mantener todo bajo perfil. Así que probablemente no deberías mencionar que has estado aquí o incluso saber que este lugar existe."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3310
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_40e78703:

#   k "Alright. Fair enough. So… where to now?"
    k "De acuerdo, me parece justo, así que... ¿a dónde vamos ahora?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3311
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_d8f9a8a1:

#   mc "There’s a café around the corner."
    mc "Hay un café a la vuelta de la esquina."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3313
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_95393e1f:

#   k "That works."
    k "Eso funciona."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3315
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_7d413f1b:

#   k "Umm… [f]? You’re not coming with us?"
    k "Umm... [f] ¿No vienes con nosotros?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3317
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_9a9af2db:

#   f "I’ve got something I need to handle. It’s important."
    f "Tengo que ocuparme de algo importante."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3318
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_6fc17f11:

#   k "Oh. That’s okay."
    k "No pasa nada."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3320
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_7910cd11:

#   k "You and I need to talk anyway, don’t you think? Probably better that it’s just us."
    k "De todas formas, tú y yo tenemos que hablar, ¿no crees? Probablemente sea mejor que seamos sólo nosotros."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3323
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_ae112015:

#   mc "Actually… there’s someone else who really wants to talk to you."
    mc "En realidad... hay alguien más que quiere hablar contigo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3325
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_8c2c73b9:

#   k "I…"
    k "I..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3326
translate HZIlle ep8_2_penthouse_after_e37b3f46:

#   k "Alright. Lead the way."
    k "Muy bien, márcales el camino."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3333
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_6d088d13:

#   k "Mother."
    k "Madre."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3335
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_c50da34c:

#   lil "[k]… sweetheart, thank god. I’m so relieved you’re safe."
    lil "[k]... cariño, gracias a Dios. Estoy tan aliviada de que estés a salvo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3336
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_8a1bc32f:

#   lil "They didn’t hurt you, did they?"
    lil "No te han hecho daño, ¿verdad?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3341
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_ebb2c010:

#   k "THEY didn’t."
    k "ELLOS no lo hicieron."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3342
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_1f7c9235:

#   k "You did."
    k "Lo has hecho."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3344
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_427b6522:

#   lil "I’m so sorry. I wish there were words...anything... that could make you understand why I did what I did."
    lil "Lo siento mucho. Ojalá hubiera palabras... cualquier cosa... que pudiera hacerte comprender por qué hice lo que hice."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3345
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_51b8dba4:

#   lil "I made awful choices. I know that. I just… I hoped someday you’d find a place in your heart to forgive me."
    lil "Tomé decisiones horribles, lo sé. Sólo... esperaba que algún día encontraras un lugar en tu corazón para perdonarme."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3347
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_31fdedd7:

#   lil "Not now. Not soon. But maybe one day."
    lil "Ahora no, pronto no, pero quizá algún día."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3348
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_82f20c5c:

#   lil "I’d do anything to have you back."
    lil "Haría cualquier cosa por tenerte de vuelta."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3350
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_c15b445a:

#   k "It’s not just the lying. I can almost stomach the idea you wanted to protect me."
    k "No es sólo la mentira. Casi puedo digerir la idea de que querías protegerme."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3352
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_68bbf463:

#   k "But you cheated. You let a man half your age fuck you."
    k "Pero hiciste trampa. Dejaste que un hombre de la mitad de tu edad te follara."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3354
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_e745108c:

#   k "And not just any guy. He worked for father. A liar. A killer. Why?!"
    k "Y no un tipo cualquiera. Trabajaba para padre. Un mentiroso. Un asesino. ¿Por qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3358
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_0f697e16:

#   k "Why would you do that to me?"
    k "¿Por qué me has hecho eso?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3360
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_eaa5b215:

#   mct "Shit… if [k] brings up what happened between us, this is going to be brutal."
    mct "Mierda... si [k] saca a relucir lo que pasó entre nosotros, esto va a ser brutal."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3362
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_3cf58a9c:

#   lil "Because he helped me. Because no one has treated me with the care and honesty he did. Not in years."
    lil "Porque me ayudó. Porque nadie me ha tratado con el cuidado y la honestidad que él lo hizo. No en años."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3363
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_d92a6a92:

#   lil "And because he kept showing up for me. Again and again."
    lil "Y porque siguió apareciendo por mí, una y otra vez."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3366
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_8973d94f:

#   k "Mhmm. Yeah. Somehow I doubt you were the only one he ‘helped.’"
    k "Sí, dudo que fueras la única a la que \"ayudó\"."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3368
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_1e79b2b4:

#   k "Go on."
    k "Continúa."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3370
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_88a65fbe:

#   lil "He stood by me, [k]. He helped me uncover your father’s affair."
    lil "Me apoyó, [k] me ayudó a descubrir la aventura de tu padre</b0>."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3372
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_dd1a608e:

#   k "W-what?!"
    k "¿Q-qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3374
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_b3510196:

#   lil "He helped me with [f], too. More than you know."
    lil "También me ayudó con [f], más de lo que crees."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3376
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_44cf9b20:

#   lil "He’s the one who came up with the idea you and [f] could reconnect. He hated the lies. He never supported keeping the truth from you."
    lil "Es a él a quien se le ocurrió la idea de que tú y [f] odiaba las mentiras. Nunca apoyó que te ocultaran la verdad."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3379
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_da0e9826:

#   k "Hated the lies, huh? Interesting choice of words."
    k "Odiaba las mentiras, ¿eh? Interesante elección de palabras."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3381
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_1a875995:

#   lil "Look… you may hate this, but what I have with him is real. He’s someone I can rely on without fear."
    lil "Mira... puede que odies esto, pero lo que tengo con él es real. Es alguien en quien puedo confiar sin miedo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3382
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_778d6228:

#   lil "And he relies on me the same way."
    lil "Y él confía en mí de la misma manera."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3384
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_1d73d932:

#   lil "We’ve survived some awful things together, and I want to keep seeing him. I just hope you won’t see that as me choosing him over you."
    lil "Hemos sobrevivido juntos a cosas horribles, y quiero seguir viéndole. Sólo espero que no lo veas como que le elijo a él antes que a ti."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3386
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_00e8eccb:

#   lil "I wish I had told you everything sooner."
    lil "Ojalá te lo hubiera contado todo antes."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3389
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_46029171:

#   k "Yeah. On that, we agree. A whole lot of heartbreak could’ve been avoided if you’d just told me the truth."
    k "Sí, en eso estamos de acuerdo. Se podrían haber evitado muchos desengaños si me hubieras dicho la verdad."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3392
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_8ae2ceee:

#   k "I wish you had too."
    k "Ojalá tú también lo hubieras hecho."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3394
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_5826f9f4:

#   lil "Do you think you could ever forgive me?"
    lil "¿Crees que podrías perdonarme alguna vez?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3396
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_8c2c73b9:

#   k "I…"
    k "I..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3398
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_f37fe164:

#   lil "Like I said, not right now. I just needed to know… do you hate me?"
    lil "Como he dicho, ahora no. Sólo necesitaba saber... ¿me odias?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3400
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_91c272a2:

#   k "I did."
    k "Lo hice."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3401
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_7b8de3d8:

#   k "My whole life I thought my family were the good ones. Turns out they’re the monsters."
    k "Toda mi vida pensé que mi familia eran los buenos, resulta que son los monstruos."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3403
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_c090b1f8:

#   k "People who use, threaten, even kill anyone who stands in their way."
    k "Personas que utilizan, amenazan e incluso matan a cualquiera que se interponga en su camino."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3404
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_3b7c1ebd:

#   k "So I ran to the other side. And they turned out just as bad."
    k "Así que corrí al otro lado. Y salieron igual de mal."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3406
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_7dba97ea:

#   k "Using me, lying to me, trying to twist me into whatever they needed. I almost died because of them."
    k "Utilizándome, mintiéndome, intentando convertirme en lo que necesitaban. Casi muero por su culpa."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3407
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_e88e6025:

#   k "And when I thought it was over… all I could think was... am I really going out hating my own mother? What does that solve?"
    k "Y cuando pensé que se había acabado... lo único que podía pensar era... ¿realmente voy a salir odiando a mi propia madre? ¿Qué resuelve eso?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3409
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_9d530ef4:

#   k "Nothing. It changes nothing."
    k "No cambia nada."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3411
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_8f6c5645:

#   k "So no. I don’t hate you."
    k "Así que no, no te odio."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3413
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_9113a3dd:

#   k "I’ve made up with [f]. And honestly… for the first time ever, I want to see if we can be something resembling a real family."
    k "Me he reconciliado con [f]. Y sinceramente... por primera vez, quiero ver si podemos ser algo parecido a una familia de verdad."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3415
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_bdb32159:

#   k "And that’s never going to happen if I keep acting like a spoiled, angry brat."
    k "Y eso nunca ocurrirá si sigo comportándome como una mocosa malcriada y enfadada."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3418
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_f0d83f25:

#   k "I don’t hate you, mom."
    k "No te odio, mamá."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3419
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_76e1a0c3:

#   k "I just want space. I want to live my own life. Away from all this insanity."
    k "Sólo quiero espacio. Quiero vivir mi propia vida. Lejos de toda esta locura."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3420
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_c621e75e:

#   k "I need to breathe again."
    k "Necesito volver a respirar."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3422
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_f31c6f24:

#   lil "I… I understand."
    lil "Yo... lo entiendo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3423
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_bb9b3f18:

#   lil "Does that mean… I’m not going to see you anymore?"
    lil "¿Significa eso que... no voy a volver a verte?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3425
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_cef246d9:

#   k "You will. Just… not like before. From time to time."
    k "De vez en cuando."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3427
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_bd281bf0:

#   lil "I love you, sweetie. I always will."
    lil "Te quiero, cariño, siempre te querré."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3429
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_01033af5:

#   k "I know, mom. I love you too."
    k "Lo sé mamá, yo también te quiero."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3433
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_3f562670:

#   k "But you should be more careful with who you trust."
    k "Pero debes tener más cuidado en quién confías."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3435
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_b26ec39e:

#   lil "What… what does that mean?"
    lil "¿Qué... qué significa eso?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3437
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_539d8238:

#   k "Can I talk to [mc]? Alone?"
    k "¿Puedo hablar a solas con [mc]?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3439
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_4d8aa2ee:

#   lil "O-of course. I’ll be just over there if you need me."
    lil "Por supuesto. Estaré por allí si me necesitas."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3441
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_cf8b216b:

#   k "Thank you, mom."
    k "Gracias, mamá."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3445
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_b743dd1e:

#   k "Can I talk to [mc] now? Alone?"
    k "¿Puedo hablar ahora con [mc] Solo?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3447
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_lil_cd5682ac:

#   lil "Of course, sweetheart. I’ll be right there."
    lil "Por supuesto, cariño, enseguida voy."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3454
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_660a3fed:

#   f "Mama!"
    f "¡Mamá!"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3455
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_94afbbc8:

#   f "How did it go?"
    f "¿Cómo ha ido?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3458
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_03d5cfb5:

#   lil "Good… surprisingly good."
    lil "Bien... sorprendentemente bien."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3459
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_e7d6f656:

#   lil "Feels like… it’s finally time for all of us to start healing."
    lil "Parece que... por fin ha llegado el momento de que todos empecemos a curarnos."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3461
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_1f06a27e:

#   f "Thank you, mama."
    f "Gracias, mamá."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3462
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_80de5ba8:

#   f "I know you had doubts about me… probably because of [z]."
    f "Sé que tenías dudas sobre mí... probablemente a causa de [z]."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3464
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_612cf56c:

#   f "And honestly, I didn’t make things easy on you either."
    f "Y, sinceramente, tampoco te lo he puesto fácil."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3465
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_a04331f8:

#   f "I’m sorry."
    f "Lo siento."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3467
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_32b8b90c:

#   lil "It’s okay, baby girl."
    lil "No pasa nada, pequeña."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3470
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_a9161b81:

#   lil "I… didn’t do great. She said she didn’t hate me, but I think she only said that so she wouldn’t hurt me more."
    lil "Yo... no lo hice muy bien. Ella dijo que no me odiaba, pero creo que sólo lo dijo para no hacerme más daño."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3472
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_72c0f418:

#   f "Yeah… she wants to be on her own for now."
    f "Sí... por ahora quiere estar sola."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3474
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_a660e802:

#   lil "Did I lose her?"
    lil "¿La he perdido?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3476
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_87425e3f:

#   f "It feels like that today. But she’ll come around. Eventually."
    f "Hoy se siente así, pero con el tiempo entrará en razón."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3477
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_93fefc5f:

#   f "I used to be just like her, remember? Blaming you and [z] for everything wrong in our family."
    f "Antes era como ella, ¿recuerdas? Os culpaba a ti y a [z] de todo lo malo de nuestra familia."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3478
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_abca132e:

#   f "But I changed. Didn’t I? And she will too. One day."
    f "Pero yo cambié, ¿no? Y ella también lo hará, algún día."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3481
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_c096422e:

#   f "No matter what happens, I’ll stand by you. Always."
    f "Pase lo que pase, estaré a tu lado, siempre."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3483
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_52b98336:

#   lil "Aww, my sweet girl…"
    lil "Aww, mi dulce niña..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3485
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_97234696:

#   f "Love you, mama."
    f "Te quiero, mamá."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3491
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_0e52b0f2:

#   mc "You didn’t tell [lil] about us. Why?"
    mc "No le hablaste a [lil] de nosotros. ¿Por qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3493
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_7f4ce33c:

#   k "Yet."
    k "Sin embargo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3494
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_fe1eb3fe:

#   k "Whether I tell her depends on you. She looked genuinely happy with you. Happier than I’ve ever seen her."
    k "Que se lo diga o no depende de ti. Parecía realmente feliz contigo. Más feliz de lo que nunca la he visto."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3496
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_9f7ea82a:

#   k "You were for her what you were for me... kind, helpful, caring, resourceful. That’s why I fell for you. Turns out mom isn’t much smarter than I am."
    k "Eras para ella lo que eras para mí... amable, servicial, atento, ingenioso. Por eso me enamoré de ti. Resulta que mamá no es mucho más lista que yo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3498
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_8242cc2c:

#   mc "You said it’s up to me. How?"
    mc "Has dicho que depende de mí. ¿Cómo?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3500
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_fb8dc3cf:

#   k "Tell me why you did all of this."
    k "Dime por qué has hecho todo esto."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3502
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_a1715063:

#   mc "It’s complicated."
    mc "Es complicado."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3504
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_55399672:

#   k "Stop. No more dodging. I could’ve destroyed you already. Don’t push me... I still can."
    k "Para. No esquives más. Ya podría haberte destruido. No me presiones... Todavía puedo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3505
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_42378b75:

#   k "Who are you really? Why did you come here?"
    k "¿Quién eres realmente? ¿Por qué has venido aquí?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3507
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_13ffa273:

#   mc "I’m an agent. A special type. I work for dangerous people... No not [hns]. Someone far outside this city."
    mc "Soy un agente. Un tipo especial. Trabajo para gente peligrosa... No, no [hns]. Alguien muy alejado de esta ciudad."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3508
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_a051fab1:

#   mc "My assignment was to get close to [z]. Infiltrate his organization. Become someone he trusted."
    mc "Mi misión era acercarme a [z]. Infiltrarme en su organización. Convertirme en alguien de su confianza."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3510
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_dbf689ef:

#   k "Just him?"
    k "¿Sólo él?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3512
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_88d9335e:

#   mc "No. Everyone around him. That meant you. And [lil]."
    mc "No. Todos los que le rodeaban. Eso significaba tú. Y [lil]."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3514
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_3d1b88af:

#   k "And [f]?"
    k "¿Y [f]?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3516
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_f126ab6f:

#   mc "At first, I didn’t even know she existed. I met her the night I pulled your father out of that ambush."
    mc "Al principio, ni siquiera sabía que existía. La conocí la noche que saqué a tu padre de aquella emboscada."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3518
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_6fb154eb:

#   k "So the whole plan was to gain his trust while fucking every woman in his family? For what?"
    k "¿Así que todo el plan consistía en ganarse su confianza follándote a todas las mujeres de su familia? ¿Para qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3520
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_db81937c:

#   mc "To steal from him."
    mc "Para robarle."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3521
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_64821ec6:

#   mc "Then everything blew up. [z] found out about me and [lil]. And even before that, the situation was slipping through my fingers."
    mc "Entonces todo estalló. [z] Me descubrió a mí y a [lil]. E incluso antes de eso, la situación se me escapaba de las manos."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3523
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_28bfee5f:

#   mc "I had to improvise, trying not to hurt anyone else in the process."
    mc "Tuve que improvisar, intentando no herir a nadie más en el proceso."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3524
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_65872ac3:

#   mc "But here we are. In the wreckage."
    mc "Pero aquí estamos, entre los restos."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3526
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_6928a0b1:

#   k "Yeah. Here we are."
    k "Sí, aquí estamos."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3527
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_a5353396:

#   k "Why did you come to the lab for me? You weren’t just rescuing me. You were searching for something. What was it?"
    k "¿Por qué viniste al laboratorio a por mí? No sólo me estabas rescatando, estabas buscando algo. ¿Qué era?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3529
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_fdd7716a:

#   mc "We thought part of [z]’s encrypted data... the thing we were ordered to obtain, was with you. And we were right."
    mc "Pensamos que parte de los datos encriptados de [z]... lo que se nos ordenó obtener, estaba contigo. Y teníamos razón."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3531
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_d5d93b70:

#   k "But you still haven’t found [z]."
    k "Pero aún no has encontrado [z]."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3532
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_70e7de7c:

#   mc "Not yet."
    mc "Todavía no."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3534
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_88705723:

#   k "You want me to help you find him, don’t you?"
    k "Quieres que te ayude a encontrarlo, ¿verdad?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3536
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_ece63c8d:

#   mc "…"
    mc "..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3537
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_601283d7:

#   k "No bullshit."
    k "Sin tonterías."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3539
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_f800bed0:

#   mc "Yes."
    mc "Sí."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3540
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_3f59a972:

#   mc "W-wait. You’re actually thinking about helping me?"
    mc "E-espera. ¿De verdad estás pensando en ayudarme?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3542
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_3f671cf1:

#   k "You saved me. You pushed me into becoming someone stronger, even if the road was bloody and painful."
    k "Me salvaste. Me empujaste a convertirme en alguien más fuerte, aunque el camino fuera sangriento y doloroso."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3543
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_3be31de9:

#   k "The least I can do is help you one last time."
    k "Lo menos que puedo hacer es ayudarte por última vez."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3545
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_d63059f9:

#   k "But first, I need your word... whatever you want from my father, he walks away alive."
    k "Pero antes, necesito tu palabra... lo que quieras de mi padre, sale vivo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3551
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_0a4dbc8d:

#   mc "I promise."
    mc "Te lo prometo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3552
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_65420c73:

#   mc "Call him. If he picks up, stall him as long as you can."
    mc "Llámale. Si descuelga, entretenle todo lo que puedas."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3554
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_cbbaaeab:

#   k "Will that help?"
    k "¿Servirá de algo?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3555
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_2836db33:

#   mc "Yeah. It’ll ping his location."
    mc "Sí, hará un ping para localizarlo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3557
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_7d74ff19:

#   k "He’s not answering."
    k "No contesta."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3558
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_d71f83b5:

#   mct "He’s expecting a trap… shit."
    mct "Espera una trampa... mierda."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3560
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_44cdb60a:

#   k "He didn’t answer my texts either. I’m sorry."
    k "Tampoco contestó a mis mensajes, lo siento."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3561
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_4ca48d56:

#   mc "It’s okay. It was a long shot."
    mc "No pasa nada, era una posibilidad remota."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3563
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_ba3fe550:

#   k "So… that’s it? Goodbye?"
    k "Entonces... ¿ya está? ¿Adiós?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3564
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_0dd5f904:

#   mc "I think so, yeah."
    mc "Creo que sí."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3566
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_98a1ba58:

#   k "You’re leaving?"
    k "¿Te vas?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3567
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_cde3b2fe:

#   mc "It’s… complicated. I wish I could explain it all, but I can’t."
    mc "Es... complicado. Ojalá pudiera explicarlo todo, pero no puedo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3569
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_0471d814:

#   k "Then… good luck."
    k "Entonces... buena suerte."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3573
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_185c9cdf:

#   mc "I don’t know what’s coming tonight. Maybe a shootout. I can’t promise [z] survives."
    mc "No sé lo que se avecina esta noche. Quizá un tiroteo. No puedo prometer que [z] sobreviva</b0>."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3575
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_9beb5e8e:

#   k "Then I can’t help you. I won’t risk it."
    k "Entonces no puedo ayudarte, no me arriesgaré."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3576
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_2c4cc44e:

#   k "Thank you for being honest."
    k "Gracias por ser sincero."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3578
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_17873514:

#   k "And another thing…"
    k "Y otra cosa..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3580
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_d62750c8:

#   k "Don’t you dare hurt my mother. If you do, I’ll show you exactly how much of my father runs in my blood."
    k "No te atrevas a hacer daño a mi madre. Si lo haces, te demostraré exactamente cuánto de mi padre corre por mi sangre."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3584
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_f0ec200c:

#   mc "Would you just… let me explain, please? I can’t handle the idea that you hate me."
    mc "¿Podrías... dejar que me explique, por favor? No puedo soportar la idea de que me odies."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3585
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_f1409c9b:

#   mc "I wish I could’ve told you everything sooner."
    mc "Ojalá hubiera podido contártelo todo antes."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3587
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_e8b97dca:

#   k "You can now. That’s the whole point of this conversation."
    k "Ahora puedes. Ése es el objetivo de esta conversación."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3588
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_780ca255:

#   k "Just be honest with me. For once."
    k "Sé sincera conmigo, por una vez."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3590
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_f99ff5bd:

#   mc "I will. I swear I will."
    mc "Lo haré, juro que lo haré."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3592
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_95f97fbd:

#   k "So who are you? Why did you get close to us? What do you really want?"
    k "¿Quién eres? ¿Por qué te has acercado a nosotros? ¿Qué quieres realmente?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3594
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_278e0353:

#   mc "I’m an agent. A special agent working for some… very dangerous people. Not [hns]. Others. People outside this city."
    mc "Soy un agente. Un agente especial que trabaja para unas personas... muy peligrosas. No [hns]. Otras. Personas de fuera de esta ciudad."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3595
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_cf27fe7f:

#   mc "My job was to get close to [z]. Slip into his world. Help him. Build trust."
    mc "Mi trabajo consistía en acercarme a [z]. Introducirme en su mundo. Ayudarle. Generar confianza."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3599
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_09941a15:

#   mc "Honestly? Everyone close to him. That included you. And [lil]…"
    mc "¿Sinceramente? Todos los que estaban cerca de él. Eso te incluía a ti. Y [lil]..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3603
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_1279e729:

#   mc "At first, I didn’t even know [f] existed. I met her by accident the night I saved your dad from [hns]."
    mc "Al principio, ni siquiera sabía que [f] existía. La conocí por accidente la noche que salvé a tu padre de [hns]."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3605
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_6edf856c:

#   k "So your job was to make my father trust you while you slept with me?"
    k "¿Así que tu trabajo consistía en hacer que mi padre confiara en ti mientras te acostabas conmigo?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3607
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_05ef5db1:

#   mc "You already know the answer. Absolutely not."
    mc "Ya sabes la respuesta: rotundamente no."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3608
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_022d2168:

#   mc "If I ever wanted to hurt you, I had a hundred chances. I chose the opposite every time."
    mc "Si alguna vez quise hacerte daño, tuve cien oportunidades. Elegí lo contrario cada vez."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3610
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_f292a556:

#   mc "Because I wanted you. I still do."
    mc "Porque te quería, todavía te quiero."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3611
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_693ff5fa:

#   mc "I’d do anything for you. But the people I work for… they’re dangerous. I didn’t know if telling you the truth would be safe."
    mc "Haría cualquier cosa por ti. Pero la gente para la que trabajo... es peligrosa. No sabía si decirte la verdad sería seguro."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3613
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_1e27f4df:

#   k "Safe for who? Didn’t my father know who you were?"
    k "¿Seguro para quién? ¿No sabía mi padre quién eras?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3615
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_a0b6a98c:

#   mc "I meant safe… for you."
    mc "Quería decir seguro... para ti."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3616
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_50e4988b:

#   mc "Everything spiraled. I lost control. People got hurt."
    mc "Todo se volvió una espiral, perdí el control y la gente salió herida."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3618
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_45d15de5:

#   mc "You got hurt."
    mc "Te has hecho daño."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3620
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_388745ce:

#   k "Yet now you’re telling me everything. Why?"
    k "Sin embargo, ahora me lo cuentas todo. ¿Por qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3621
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_3406d42d:

#   mc "Because it’s the end of it. I finish my mission tonight… or the mission finishes me."
    mc "Porque es el final. Esta noche acabo mi misión... o la misión acaba conmigo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3623
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_b85f8c79:

#   k "I see."
    k "Ya veo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3624
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_ccf5a24e:

#   k "Did you find what you were searching for at the lab?"
    k "¿Encontraste lo que buscabas en el laboratorio?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3626
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_8fa2a32d:

#   mc "Yeah. It was a piece of data [z] trusted you with. And we… needed to steal it."
    mc "Sí. Era un dato que [z] te había confiado</b0>. Y nosotros... necesitábamos robarlo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3627
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_b678cff4:

#   k "Hm."
    k "Hm."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3629
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_35624585:

#   k "So you’re not here just to patch things up. You need something from me."
    k "Así que no estás aquí sólo para arreglar las cosas, necesitas algo de mí."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3630
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_2d4ddcd6:

#   mc "It’s not that simple. Just because I need your help doesn’t mean I only see you as a tool."
    mc "No es tan sencillo. Que necesite tu ayuda no significa que sólo te vea como una herramienta."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3632
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_240dbfb8:

#   k "Fine. Then tell me what you need."
    k "Bien. Entonces dime qué necesitas."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3633
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_2f0e18f4:

#   mc "…I need to locate [z]."
    mc "...necesito localizar [z]."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3635
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_467ce279:

#   k "I’ll help you."
    k "Yo te ayudaré."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3637
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_cd56b379:

#   mc "W–what?"
    mc "¿Q-qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3639
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_04c92899:

#   k "You saved me. You changed me. Even through all the bullshit, you made me stronger."
    k "Me salvaste. Me cambiaste. Incluso a través de toda la mierda, me hiciste más fuerte."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3640
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_3a13734d:

#   k "The least I can do is give something back."
    k "Lo menos que puedo hacer es devolver algo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3642
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_c97fb2ae:

#   k "But on one condition."
    k "Pero con una condición."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3643
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_f7831ead:

#   k "You promise you won’t hurt my father. Take whatever you need from him and leave him alone. Let him live."
    k "Promete que no harás daño a mi padre. Coge lo que necesites de él y déjale en paz. Déjale vivir."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3649
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_1140a1d6:

#   mc "Call him. If he answers, stall him as long as you can."
    mc "Llámale. Si contesta, entretenle todo lo que puedas."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3651
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_fbfc413e:

#   k "And that helps?"
    k "¿Y eso ayuda?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3652
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_4490805b:

#   mc "It gives me a lock on his location."
    mc "Me da una pista de su ubicación."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3654
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_6ab76fdd:

#   k "He’s not picking up."
    k "No contesta."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3657
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_698d4657:

#   k "No answer to texts either. I’m sorry."
    k "Tampoco contesto a los mensajes, lo siento."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3658
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_eb7db77d:

#   mc "It’s alright. It was worth a try."
    mc "Vale la pena intentarlo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3660
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_f6e50bfd:

#   k "So… this is goodbye?"
    k "Entonces... ¿esto es el adiós?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3661
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_5ef70042:

#   mc "I think so."
    mc "Creo que sí."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3664
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_208be981:

#   mc "It’s complicated. I wish I could tell you more, but I can’t."
    mc "Es complicado. Ojalá pudiera decirte más, pero no puedo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3670
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_8116c499:

#   mc "I don’t know how tonight goes down. Could be a shootout. I can’t promise [z] survives."
    mc "No sé cómo irá esta noche. Podría ser un tiroteo. No puedo prometer que [z] sobreviva."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3671
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_af5272b9:

#   k "Then I can’t help you. I won’t put him in that kind of danger."
    k "Entonces no puedo ayudarte. No le pondré en ese peligro."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3676
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_8a85fa7e:

#   k "Who the hell are you? Why did you worm your way into our family? What do you want from us?"
    k "¿Quién demonios eres? ¿Por qué te has colado en nuestra familia? ¿Qué quieres de nosotros?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3678
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_7858b1cc:

#   mc "I’m an agent. A special agent working for some… very dangerous people. And no, not [hns]. Others. Outside this city."
    mc "Soy un agente. Un agente especial que trabaja para unas personas... muy peligrosas. Y no, no [hns]. Otras. Fuera de esta ciudad."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3679
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_046d68ff:

#   mc "My job was to get close to [z]. Slip into his world. Help him. Earn his trust."
    mc "Mi trabajo consistía en acercarme a [z]. Introducirme en su mundo. Ayudarle. Ganarme su confianza."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3683
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_9d780d40:

#   mc "Honestly? No. Everyone around him. That meant you. And [lil]…"
    mc "¿Sinceramente? No. Todos los que le rodeaban. Eso significaba que tú. Y [lil]..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3687
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_a31cf8a7:

#   mc "Back then, I didn’t even know who [f] was. I met her by accident the night I saved your father from [hns]."
    mc "Por aquel entonces, ni siquiera sabía quién era [f] . La conocí por accidente la noche que salvé a tu padre de [hns]."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3689
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_8c6bb51d:

#   k "So that was the assignment? Gain his trust while you fuck half the family?"
    k "¿Así que esa era la misión? ¿Ganarte su confianza mientras te follas a media familia?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3691
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_3a889ee0:

#   mc "Things spiraled. I lost control of everything. [z] found out. I got screwed. And here we are."
    mc "Las cosas se precipitaron. Perdí el control de todo. [z] Me enteré. Me jodieron. Y aquí estamos."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3693
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_b4037ebb:

#   k "Yeah. One big pile of shit."
    k "Sí, un gran montón de mierda."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3694
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_d3a70fd2:

#   k "So why did you even come to the lab? You weren’t saving me. You were looking for something. What was it?"
    k "Entonces, ¿por qué viniste al laboratorio? No me estabas salvando, sino buscando algo. ¿Qué era?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3696
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_c88e28c6:

#   mc "We believed a piece of [z]’s data—the one we needed to steal—was hidden with you. And it was. We found it."
    mc "Creíamos que una parte de los datos de [z] -la que necesitábamos robar- estaba oculta contigo. Y así era. La encontramos."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3698
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_12a21402:

#   k "Of course. Figures."
    k "Por supuesto. Figuras."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3699
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_073b0ec6:

#   k "So the real reason you wanted this talk is...?"
    k "¿Así que la verdadera razón por la que querías esta charla es...?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3701
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_566d630c:

#   mc "I need your help."
    mc "Necesito tu ayuda."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3703
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_80a491b2:

#   k "With what?"
    k "¿Con qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3705
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_26447978:

#   mc "Finding him."
    mc "Encontrarle."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3707
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_7c2bde7e:

#   k "Why?"
    k "¿Por qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3709
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_a6620abe:

#   mc "So I can finish what I was sent here to do."
    mc "Así podré terminar lo que me enviaron a hacer."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3710
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_d0440811:

#   k "Just like before? Let things spiral out of control again? Maybe kill him this time... by accident or on purpose?"
    k "¿Igual que antes? ¿Dejar que las cosas vuelvan a descontrolarse? ¿Quizá matarlo esta vez... por accidente o a propósito?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3712
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_f8ac94af:

#   k "You really think I’m going to hand him over to you?"
    k "¿De verdad crees que te lo voy a entregar?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3713
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_948d8eae:

#   mc "Saving your ass means nothing to you? Doesn’t make me even a little more trustworthy?"
    mc "¿Salvarte el culo no significa nada para ti? ¿No me hace ni siquiera un poco más digno de confianza?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3715
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_3043d2da:

#   k "Please. If you never showed up, none of this shit would’ve happened. I wouldn’t need saving. I’d just be safe."
    k "Por favor. Si nunca hubieras aparecido, nada de esta mierda habría ocurrido. No necesitaría que me salvaran. Simplemente estaría a salvo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3716
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_34ad7508:

#   mc "Safe? Would you? I didn’t start any of this. [hns] did."
    mc "¿Seguro? ¿Lo harías? Yo no empecé nada de esto. [hns] Lo hizo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3718
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_8a5b0b75:

#   k "You actually expect me to believe that?"
    k "¿De verdad esperas que me lo crea?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3719
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_cf639598:

#   k "Your heroic act doesn’t fool me anymore, [mc]. You create disaster, then swoop in pretending to fix it."
    k "Tu acto heroico ya no me engaña, [mc]. Creas el desastre y luego te abalanzas pretendiendo arreglarlo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3720
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_a9f2772d:

#   k "I’d rather die than help you."
    k "Prefiero morir a ayudarte."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3722
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_bb2a2e16:

#   mc "Maybe that’s exactly what will happen."
    mc "Puede que eso sea exactamente lo que ocurra."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3724
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_69476629:

#   k "We’re done here."
    k "Ya hemos terminado."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3597
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_dbf689ef_1:

#   k "Just him?"
    k "¿Sólo él?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3681
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_dbf689ef_2:

#   k "Just him?"
    k "¿Sólo él?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3601
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_3d1b88af_1:

#   k "And [f]?"
    k "¿Y [f]?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3685
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_3d1b88af_2:

#   k "And [f]?"
    k "¿Y [f]?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3648
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_0a4dbc8d_1:

#   mc "I promise."
    mc "Te lo prometo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3655
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_d71f83b5_1:

#   mct "He’s expecting a trap… shit."
    mct "Espera una trampa... mierda."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3663
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_98a1ba58_1:

#   k "You’re leaving?"
    k "¿Te vas?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3666
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_0471d814_1:

#   k "Then… good luck."
    k "Entonces... buena suerte."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3673
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_mc_2c4cc44e_1:

#   k "Thank you for being honest."
    k "Gracias por ser sincero."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3731
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_d06d534b:

#   lil "Ehh..."
    lil "Ehh..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3733
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_27944507:

#   mc "Hey, talk to me. What’s going on?"
    mc "Oye, háblame. ¿Qué pasa?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3735
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_f70df40a:

#   lil "Why do I feel like everything is about to end?"
    lil "¿Por qué siento que todo está a punto de acabar?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3736
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_73f426b0:

#   lil "I heard you with your team. You need to find Hector before midnight."
    lil "Tienes que encontrar a Héctor antes de medianoche."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3738
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_f3eefd2f:

#   lil "Why do I feel like… no matter how this turns out… I’m never going to see you again?"
    lil "¿Por qué siento que... no importa cómo acabe esto... nunca volveré a verte?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3739
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_1bfe57b7:

#   lil "Tell me, was I… was I just being used?"
    lil "Dime, ¿estaba... estaba siendo utilizado?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3741
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_c936a8ed:

#   mc "Look at me, [lil]."
    mc "Mírame, [lil]."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3742
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_7e688c10:

#   mc "You’re the woman I love."
    mc "Eres la mujer que amo."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3744
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_83078e78:

#   mc "I love you."
    mc "Te quiero."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3745
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_ae5151dc:

#   mc "And I would never hurt you. Never use you."
    mc "Y nunca te haría daño, nunca te utilizaría."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3747
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_0c3cc7dd:

#   lil "I-I… I know, [mc]. But that still doesn’t answer what I asked."
    lil "Ya... ya lo sé, [mc] pero eso sigue sin responder a lo que te he preguntado."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3749
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_f318f67c:

#   lil "Is this… goodbye?"
    lil "¿Esto es... un adiós?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3751
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_1de83f6b:

#   mc "It’s complicated. God, it’s so fucking complicated. I don’t even know where to start."
    mc "Es complicado. Dios, es tan jodidamente complicado que no sé ni por dónde empezar."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3752
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_38cb8147:

#   mc "Fuck!"
    mc "¡Joder!"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3753
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_4d2fd69f:

#   mc "Do you trust me?"
    mc "¿Confías en mí?"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3755
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_3c394eb9:

#   lil "Of course I do."
    lil "Por supuesto que sí."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3757
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_25ba71ba:

#   mc "Then I need you to really trust me. Because what I’m about to say is insane. You’ll think I’ve lost my mind."
    mc "Entonces necesito que confíes de verdad en mí. Porque lo que voy a decirte es una locura. Pensarás que he perdido la cabeza."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3758
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_47b8a1b8:

#   mct "I'm telling her it's a simulation! Fuck it!"
    mct "¡Le digo que es una simulación! ¡A la mierda!"

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3760
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_9cfa2fe3:

#   lil "Shhh..."
    lil "Shhh..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3761
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_3e516317:

#   lil "Tell me you love me."
    lil "Dime que me quieres."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3763
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_369b4712:

#   mc "I love you. More than anything."
    mc "Te quiero, más que a nada."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3764
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_a6742cf5:

#   mct "I'm saying it..."
    mct "Lo estoy diciendo..."

# game/episodes/Ep8_2/episode8_2.rpy:3766
translate HZIlle ep8_2_cafe_after_a4289e30:

